        "text_color": "#1a1816",
        "accent_color": "#8a8279",
        "divider_color": "#d4cec6",
        "eyebrow": "Product Overview",
        "title": "Double the Power. Twice the Possibility.",
        "text": "The Sensol RS03 represents a generational leap in home strength training. With 45 kg of digital resistance adjustable in 1 kg increments, the servo motor deliver 500 watts of digital force - precise enough for clinical rehabilitation, powerful enough for elite athletic training. 200+ guided movements across three training modes put a complete strength studio in the footprint of a coffee table."
      }
    },
    "feature_01": {
      "type": "sensol-product-feature",
      "blocks": {
        "stat_1": {
          "type": "stat",
          "settings": {
            "number": "1 kg",
            "label": "Increment step"
          }
        },
        "stat_2": {
          "type": "stat",
          "settings": {
            "number": "45 kg",
            "label": "Max resistance"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "stat_1",
        "stat_2"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "light",
        "image_position": "left",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screen_Shot_2026-04-30_at_12.17.12_PM.png",
        "eyebrow": "01 — Digital Weight",
        "title": "1 kg precision. No springs. No guesswork.",
        "text_1": "Every spring-loaded reformer before the RS03 forced a compromise: a click, a swap, a missing plate. RS03 replaces all of that with a digitally controlled motor. Cable tension is measured 1,000 times per second and adjusted in real time, so 1 kg is exactly 1 kg - at the top of the pull, at the bottom, and through every millimetre of the stroke.",
        "text_2": "Two motors, two cables, two independent forces. The left arm can pull at 14 kg while the right pushes at 22.5 - simultaneously, from one machine, without a single weight swap."
      }
    },
    "feature_02": {
      "type": "sensol-product-feature",
      "blocks": {
        "stat_1": {
          "type": "stat",
          "settings": {
            "number": "145°",
            "label": "Arm range"
          }
        },
        "stat_2": {
          "type": "stat",
          "settings": {
            "number": "3",
            "label": "Training modes"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "stat_1",
        "stat_2"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "dark",
        "image_position": "right",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screen_Shot_2026-04-30_at_12.17.28_PM.png",
        "eyebrow": "02 — Expanded Range & Modes",
        "title": "145° of movement. Three ways to train.",
        "text_1": "The RS03 arm rotates through 145° - enough to reproduce a full Pilates repertoire plus the long-arc pulls of cable strength training. Lock it at 90° for closed-chain chest press, or unlock it for free-path movements no fixed-cable machine can match.",
        "text_2": "Three training modes meet you where you are. Pilates Mode for classical reformer repertoire. Strength Mode for traditional cable-based hypertrophy. Free Mode for the movements no machine has ever let you do before."
      }
    },
    "feature_03": {
      "type": "sensol-product-feature",
      "blocks": {
        "stat_1": {
          "type": "stat",
          "settings": {
            "number": "2",
            "label": "Functions in 1"
          }
        },
        "stat_2": {
