        "image_position": "right",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/imgi_255_Screen_Shot_2026-04-30_at_12.17.28_PM.png",
        "eyebrow": "04 — Compact & Connected",
        "title": "Apartment-friendly. AI-coached. Subscription-free.",
        "text_1": "109 × 35 cm. Fits in any room, in any apartment, alongside any sofa. 45 dB at full load - quieter than a normal conversation - so you can train at 6am without waking anyone. No wall mount, no ceiling clearance, no dedicated studio required.",
        "text_2": "The companion app unlocks 300+ classes, live metric tracking, and AI form coaching. Free for the life of the machine. No subscription. No upsell. No data lock-in."
      }
    },
